<h1>Payout request needs attention ⚠️</h1>

<p>Hi {{organizerName}},</p>

<p>Your payout request couldn't be processed. The good news: it's an easy fix!</p>

<div style="background-color: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; padding: 16px; margin: 24px 0; border-radius: 4px;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #991b1b;">What Happened</h3>
  <p style="margin: 0;">{{rejectionReason}}</p>
</div>

<div style="background-color: #fafaf9; border: 1px solid #e7e5e4; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; margin: 24px 0;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0; font-size: 16px;">Payout Summary</h3>
  <p style="margin: 12px 0 0 0;"><strong>Amount:</strong> {{amount}}</p>
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #78716c;">Review your bank details and resubmit.</p>
</div>

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px;">How to Fix It</h3>

<ol style="color: #78716c; line-height: 1.8; margin: 12px 0;">
  <li>Check your account number and bank name</li>
  <li>Make sure your account holder name matches your ID</li>
  <li>Resubmit with the corrected details</li>
</ol>

{{> ctaButton text="Resubmit Payout" url=resubmitLink }}

<h3 style="margin-top: 24px;">Need Help?</h3>

<p>If you're not sure what's wrong, reply to this email and we'll help you get it sorted quickly.</p>

<p style="color: #a8a29e; margin-top: 32px;">Let's get your money out! 💪</p>
